@@ -2,6 +2,16 @@
 
 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+## Agent form tools
+
+In browsers that support declarative WebMCP, the sign-in and sign-up pages expose
+the `sign-in` and `sign-up` tools. Each takes the required `username` and `password`
+parameters from the named form controls. Agents fill the forms, and the user
+reviews and submits them (the forms intentionally omit `toolautosubmit`).
+Both tools use the existing account APIs and return the same success or error
+message shown in the UI through the submit event's `respondWith()` method.
+Browsers without WebMCP support continue to use the forms normally.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
